-Yes.

749
00:41:02,543 --> 00:41:04,212
LEE JOONSU, KIM DDOLDDOL

750
00:41:04,295 --> 00:41:07,298
[host] Tagged players,
please head to prison.

751
00:41:07,382 --> 00:41:10,468
COPS AND ROBBERS ROUND 1

752
00:41:11,135 --> 00:41:14,514
THE GROUNDS

753
00:41:15,223 --> 00:41:20,937
THE POOL

754
00:41:21,521 --> 00:41:24,524
HOTEL BASEMENT

755
00:41:24,607 --> 00:41:25,608
Where is it?

756
00:41:26,526 --> 00:41:27,527
[coughs]

757
00:41:31,406 --> 00:41:34,117
[Jaegyun] I found four in ten minutes.

758
00:41:34,200 --> 00:41:37,412
I was told not to keep looking
beyond that.

759
00:41:37,495 --> 00:41:40,665
I found one more from the photo
and kept its location in mind.

760
00:41:41,165 --> 00:41:45,169
HWANG JAEGYUN CHECKS
ROUND 2 CLUE LOCATIONS IN ADVANCE

761
00:41:49,048 --> 00:41:53,970
FOOTSTEPS ECHO IN THE DISTANCE

762
00:41:54,053 --> 00:41:56,055
