764
00:42:04,230 --> 00:42:06,232
[♪ fast-paced music playing]

765
00:42:09,986 --> 00:42:13,281
BASEBALL STAR HWANG JAEGYUN
VS UDT YUK JUNSEO

766
00:42:16,451 --> 00:42:17,744
