769
00:42:31,966 --> 00:42:33,968
[♪ fast-paced music continues playing]

770
00:42:46,439 --> 00:42:49,025
[panting]

771
00:42:49,525 --> 00:42:53,446
YUK JUNSEO LOSES HWANG JAEGYUN

772
00:42:57,992 --> 00:43:01,496
PICKS UP DROPPED CLUE

773
00:43:01,579 --> 00:43:03,581
[panting]

774
00:43:07,418 --> 00:43:10,046
HWANG JAEGYUN MAKES HIS WAY
UP TO THE GROUNDS

775
00:43:10,129 --> 00:43:11,964
I dropped a clue.

776
00:43:20,765 --> 00:43:23,726
