777
00:43:27,355 --> 00:43:29,899
POOL: B3-B1
ANNEX: B2-2F

778
00:43:29,982 --> 00:43:32,318
THE ATMOSPHERE IS TENSE

779
00:43:32,401 --> 00:43:33,694
[Jimin exclaims]

780
00:43:43,121 --> 00:43:44,413
[footsteps approaching]

781
00:43:45,706 --> 00:43:48,126
[♪ exciting music playing]

782
00:43:52,380 --> 00:43:53,381
[Jimin] No!

783
00:43:53,881 --> 00:43:54,882
[yelps]

784
00:43:55,633 --> 00:43:57,343
[host] Tag confirmed.

785
00:43:59,303 --> 00:44:03,015
GOES LOOKING FOR JAEGYUN
WITHOUT CATCHING HIS BREATH

786
00:44:03,141 --> 00:44:05,810
[Jimin] I hadn't found any clues yet,
and I got caught so quickly.

787
00:44:05,893 --> 00:44:07,103
GENERAL CLUES: 0
DECISIVE CLUES: 0

788
00:44:07,186 --> 00:44:09,063
But it is what it is.

789
00:44:09,147 --> 00:44:10,982
I'd rather be in prison early

790
00:44:11,065 --> 00:44:13,818
and focus on figuring out
who the Good Citizens are

791
00:44:13,901 --> 00:44:15,069
and who's the Madman.

792
00:44:15,153 --> 00:44:18,030
That would give me
a better chance of winning.

793
00:44:18,114 --> 00:44:22,451
Because this is an area
where you can put on an act.

794
00:44:22,535 --> 00:44:25,997
PARK JIMIN

795
00:44:26,581 --> 00:44:28,583
[panting]

796
00:44:40,845 --> 00:44:43,639
HWANG JAEGYUN COMES BACK TO THE POOL AREA

797
00:44:44,807 --> 00:44:48,561
[Jaegyun] I couldn't keep
running for long, but I thought

798
00:44:48,644 --> 00:44:51,564
I could get away from them
over short distances.

799
00:44:51,647 --> 00:44:55,109
I was determined to stay away
from the cops for as long as possible.

800
00:44:56,986 --> 00:44:59,030
[Eunsil] Have you been to the Annex?

801
00:44:59,113 --> 00:45:01,407
There should be one or two
down by the Pool.

802
00:45:01,490 --> 00:45:02,825
[Eunsil] The lower level?

803
00:45:02,909 --> 00:45:05,453
-The basement.
-[Junseo] Let's go together.

804
00:45:07,413 --> 00:45:10,666
THE POOL

805
00:45:13,294 --> 00:45:16,005
CASINO: HOTEL B1
POOL: B1

806
00:45:16,589 --> 00:45:19,050
CASINO: HOTEL B1
POOL: B1

807
00:45:19,133 --> 00:45:20,176
There he is.

808
00:45:22,094 --> 00:45:23,179
[chuckles]

809
00:45:23,262 --> 00:45:25,264
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

810
00:45:28,851 --> 00:45:31,020
-Let's go.
-[Eunsil] Let's split up.

811
00:45:37,944 --> 00:45:38,945
What the heck?

812
00:45:53,292 --> 00:45:58,506
[Junseo] Jaegyun was so fast
he was already out of my sight.

813
00:45:58,589 --> 00:45:59,674
HWANG JAEGYUN DISAPPEARED

814
00:46:06,806 --> 00:46:08,391
[panting]

815
00:46:24,240 --> 00:46:27,076
YUK JUNSEO KEEPS CHASING HIM

816
00:46:34,333 --> 00:46:36,669
I'm dropping everything.

817
00:46:36,752 --> 00:46:38,129
[groans]

818
00:46:42,800 --> 00:46:44,802
[both panting]

819
00:46:46,262 --> 00:46:47,263
[Jaegyun groans]

820
00:46:47,763 --> 00:46:49,056
-[patch rips]
-Sorry.

821
00:46:49,140 --> 00:46:50,224
[Jaegyun] No worries.

822
00:46:50,308 --> 00:46:52,018
I keep dropping clues.

823
00:46:52,101 --> 00:46:53,102
My goodness.

824
00:46:53,686 --> 00:46:55,354
[host] Tag confirmed.

825
00:46:55,438 --> 00:46:57,857
JUNSEO TAGS JAEGYUN

826
00:47:02,320 --> 00:47:04,155
[Jaegyun] Seeing him run at me was scary.

827
00:47:06,324 --> 00:47:07,658
CURRENT ARREST STATUS

828
00:47:07,742 --> 00:47:10,036
CI: JOONSU, DDOLDDOL
VIOLENT CRIMES: JIMIN, JAEGYUN

829
00:47:11,078 --> 00:47:13,497
THE GROUNDS

830
00:47:18,753 --> 00:47:21,756
[breathing heavily]

831
00:47:45,029 --> 00:47:46,030
There he is.

832
00:47:46,530 --> 00:47:48,532
[♪ fast-paced music playing]

833
00:47:50,076 --> 00:47:53,662
THE ANNEX

834
00:48:13,724 --> 00:48:16,352
HOTEL

835
00:48:18,104 --> 00:48:20,064
[panting]

836
00:48:28,447 --> 00:48:30,449
[breathing heavily]

837
00:48:32,451 --> 00:48:35,287
YANG DAIL HAS DISAPPEARED

838
00:48:36,163 --> 00:48:38,499
[Sanghyun] He was faster than I expected.
I was flustered.

839
00:48:38,582 --> 00:48:41,043
He's not here. Earlier...

840
00:48:46,424 --> 00:48:51,137
THE POOL

841
00:48:59,728 --> 00:49:01,647
By the pool,

842
00:49:01,730 --> 00:49:04,150
I spotted a silhouette,
and it looked like a man.

843
00:49:05,276 --> 00:49:06,819
[♪ sinister music plays]

844
00:49:10,531 --> 00:49:14,535
AS QUIETLY AS POSSIBLE TO NOT BE DETECTED

845
00:49:17,997 --> 00:49:20,875
ENTERING THE POOL AREA

846
00:49:21,500 --> 00:49:23,419
Horseking was there.

847
00:49:24,128 --> 00:49:26,964
HORSEKING IS COLLECTING CLUES

848
00:49:30,926 --> 00:49:33,679
YOUN SANGHYUN CLOSES IN FAST

849
00:49:35,556 --> 00:49:36,891
Isn't he a cop?

850
00:49:38,309 --> 00:49:39,351
I suppose he is.

851
00:49:46,150 --> 00:49:49,278
FULL SPRINT

852
00:49:53,073 --> 00:49:54,074
I'm out of gas.

853
00:49:56,702 --> 00:50:00,831
SANGHYUN IS EXHAUSTED AFTER CHASING DAIL

854
00:50:00,915 --> 00:50:05,920
HORSEKING GETS AWAY EFFORTLESSLY

855
00:50:06,504 --> 00:50:08,881
[panting heavily]

856
00:50:13,302 --> 00:50:16,013
SANGHYUN HEADS THE OPPOSITE WAY
TO WHERE HORSEKING WENT

857
00:50:16,805 --> 00:50:21,227
POOL: B3-B1
ANNEX: B2-2F

858
00:50:22,269 --> 00:50:26,732
POOL: B3-B1
ANNEX: B2-2F

859
00:50:29,026 --> 00:50:32,321
THE TWO HEAD TO THE SAME SPOT

860
00:50:36,367 --> 00:50:37,660
LOOKING AROUND

861
00:50:39,161 --> 00:50:40,162
There he is.

862
00:50:40,246 --> 00:50:42,122
[♪ tense music playing]

863
00:50:43,082 --> 00:50:46,085
SEES HIM LATE

864
00:50:57,930 --> 00:51:00,015
YOUN SANGHYUN QUICKLY CATCHES UP

865
00:51:07,106 --> 00:51:09,108
[♪ tense music intensifies]

866
00:51:09,692 --> 00:51:11,110
[both panting]

867
00:51:19,118 --> 00:51:23,831
I grabbed Horseking,
but he was much stronger than I thought.

868
00:51:29,587 --> 00:51:32,590
[Horseking] I've played
a lot of different sports

869
00:51:32,673 --> 00:51:35,884
and especially the ones
that involve physical strength.

870
00:51:35,968 --> 00:51:38,721
I had no fear,
because I could beat anyone.

871
00:51:39,263 --> 00:51:40,264
I will win.

872
00:51:40,931 --> 00:51:44,893
STANDOFF

873
00:51:46,103 --> 00:51:49,857
HORSEKING STARTS TO MOVE

874
00:51:56,280 --> 00:51:57,406
[both grunting]

875
00:51:58,574 --> 00:51:59,950
[Sanghyun] Be careful!

876
00:52:04,913 --> 00:52:07,374
[both grunting]

877
00:52:07,458 --> 00:52:08,626
[patch rips]

878
00:52:08,709 --> 00:52:11,170
-[groans] Sorry.
-It's all right.

879
00:52:11,754 --> 00:52:13,255
-Let's go.
-All right.

880
00:52:14,673 --> 00:52:15,841
[host] Tag confirmed.

881
00:52:15,924 --> 00:52:16,925
JUNSEO TAGS HORSEKING

882
00:52:17,801 --> 00:52:18,844
You're so reliable.

883
00:52:20,429 --> 00:52:22,556
[Horseking] I was tagged by Junseo.

884
00:52:22,640 --> 00:52:24,391
I was really caught off guard.

885
00:52:24,475 --> 00:52:27,478
I didn't even get a chance to fight back.

886
00:52:27,561 --> 00:52:29,188
He totally got me.

887
00:52:29,271 --> 00:52:32,858
Our team agreed to call the person
who could help right away.

888
00:52:34,068 --> 00:52:37,613
AN INCOMING CALL
AFTER CATCHING HWANG JAEGYUN

889
00:52:37,696 --> 00:52:39,114
Where are you, Sanghyun?

890
00:52:39,198 --> 00:52:41,283
[Sanghyun] Come back
to where the game started.

891
00:52:41,367 --> 00:52:42,368
Okay.

892
00:52:42,451 --> 00:52:44,286
CHASES HORSEKING WITHOUT TAKING A BREAK

893
00:52:48,082 --> 00:52:49,958
SPOTS HORSEKING

894
00:52:50,042 --> 00:52:52,127
[Junseo] I looked around...

895
00:52:52,795 --> 00:52:54,546
and I knew I had him.

896
00:52:54,630 --> 00:52:55,673
SNEAKING IN

897
00:52:55,756 --> 00:52:57,383
I had to catch him.

898
00:53:00,511 --> 00:53:01,762
[both grunting]

899
00:53:02,429 --> 00:53:03,931
HORSEKING TAGGED IN AN AMBUSH

900
00:53:04,014 --> 00:53:05,683
-Sorry.
-It's all right.

901
00:53:05,766 --> 00:53:06,850
-Let's go.
-All right.

902
00:53:08,560 --> 00:53:12,064
HORSEKING

903
00:53:12,147 --> 00:53:13,691
JUNSEO'S PRISON FILLS UP FIRST

904
00:53:13,774 --> 00:53:14,983
[Jaegyun] Welcome.

905
00:53:15,067 --> 00:53:16,151
-Hello.
-Hello.

906
00:53:16,860 --> 00:53:18,070
Did you find all four?

907
00:53:18,153 --> 00:53:21,073
I did, but I didn't bring them over.

908
00:53:21,156 --> 00:53:22,408
What?

909
00:53:22,491 --> 00:53:23,617
-Why not?
-Why not?

910
00:53:24,451 --> 00:53:25,619
I didn't know I had to.

911
00:53:25,703 --> 00:53:27,454
[Jaegyun] They told us to keep them.

912
00:53:29,081 --> 00:53:31,041
-I thought it was for later.
-[Jaegyun] Really?

913
00:53:31,125 --> 00:53:33,419
So you found clues and left them there?

914
00:53:33,502 --> 00:53:35,421
I left everything there.

915
00:53:35,504 --> 00:53:37,131
You left them where they were?

916
00:53:37,214 --> 00:53:39,341
[Horseking] No, I hid them somewhere else.

917
00:53:39,425 --> 00:53:42,219
He said he hid the clues
and didn't bring them.

918
00:53:42,302 --> 00:53:43,804
He was talking nonsense.

919
00:53:43,887 --> 00:53:45,222
Now, we need to find out

920
00:53:45,305 --> 00:53:46,974
-Assault Criminal 1 and 2.
-Yeah.

921
00:53:47,057 --> 00:53:48,600
Assault Criminal 1, 2, and 3.

922
00:53:49,309 --> 00:53:51,395
Mine doesn't show 1 and 2.

923
00:53:52,688 --> 00:53:55,315
-What?
-It doesn't show, how do I know who's 1?

924
00:53:56,567 --> 00:53:57,943
It doesn't say anything?

925
00:53:58,026 --> 00:54:00,195
-It's not here.
-You're not supposed to show it.

926
00:54:00,279 --> 00:54:02,740
[laughs]

927
00:54:02,823 --> 00:54:04,867
And he was trying to show his card.

928
00:54:04,950 --> 00:54:08,078
He looked like he was totally clueless.

929
00:54:08,162 --> 00:54:09,329
What was that about?

930
00:54:09,413 --> 00:54:13,459
Seriously, I grew increasingly suspicious.

931
00:54:13,542 --> 00:54:15,919
What is he? Is he just a Good Citizen?

932
00:54:16,003 --> 00:54:17,421
Or the Madman?

933
00:54:17,963 --> 00:54:21,717
HORSEKING'S ACTIONS SPARK SUSPICION

934
00:54:21,800 --> 00:54:23,427
[host] Tag confirmed.

935
00:54:24,011 --> 00:54:25,387
[Horseking] Another one got caught?

936
00:54:25,471 --> 00:54:28,599
YOUN SANGHYUN'S PRISON
KIM DDOLDDOL, LEE JOONSU

937
00:54:29,224 --> 00:54:32,060
YUK JUNSEO'S PRISON
PARK JIMIN, HWANG JAEGYUN, HORSEKING

938
00:54:32,686 --> 00:54:33,896
JANG EUNSIL'S PRISON

939
00:54:33,979 --> 00:54:35,606
EMPTY

940
00:54:35,689 --> 00:54:37,900
[Eunsil] I couldn't find my way at first.

941
00:54:37,983 --> 00:54:39,318
I kept getting lost.

942
00:54:39,401 --> 00:54:43,071
The building was huge,
the chase area was massive,

943
00:54:43,155 --> 00:54:47,117
and the pool area was so big
that I couldn't spot anyone.

944
00:54:48,118 --> 00:54:49,661
I think I'm in the wrong place.

945
00:54:49,745 --> 00:54:51,830
Damn it. This is confusing.

946
00:54:53,916 --> 00:54:55,000
I'm lost.

947
00:54:55,083 --> 00:54:58,128
WASTED TIME FROM GETTING LOST

948
00:54:59,421 --> 00:55:00,422
Where's the Annex?

949
00:55:04,384 --> 00:55:06,637
Seriously, I have no idea.

950
00:55:08,388 --> 00:55:10,474
COPS AND ROBBERS ROUND 1

951
00:55:10,557 --> 00:55:11,683
[ZZONE] Interrogation...

952
00:55:11,767 --> 00:55:12,976
Damn it.

953
00:55:13,602 --> 00:55:16,855
ZZONE IS HIDING IN THE POOL AREA

954
00:55:17,439 --> 00:55:18,941
[host] Tag confirmed.

955
00:55:19,608 --> 00:55:20,609
[exclaims]

956
00:55:22,653 --> 00:55:23,946
The Pool?

957
00:55:24,488 --> 00:55:26,949
This one. Coffee. I found that.

958
00:55:28,158 --> 00:55:30,452
[ZZONE] Luckily, in Round 1,

959
00:55:30,536 --> 00:55:32,538
I was able to find
the key clues right away.

960
00:55:32,621 --> 00:55:36,917
From that point on,
I decided to stay hidden.

961
00:55:37,000 --> 00:55:40,170
Of the nine people,
who are the Good Citizens?

962
00:55:41,463 --> 00:55:43,632
Who are the Drug Criminals? Not Jaegyun.

963
00:55:44,967 --> 00:55:47,052
Who got caught? This is driving me crazy.

964
00:55:48,637 --> 00:55:49,721
Jimin...

965
00:55:49,805 --> 00:55:50,889
JOONSU, HORSEKING, DAIL

966
00:55:50,973 --> 00:55:52,099
Jaegyun...

967
00:55:54,142 --> 00:55:55,227
Yang Dail.

968
00:55:58,272 --> 00:56:01,984
THE SOUND OF A PHONE
RINGING SOMEWHERE

969
00:56:02,484 --> 00:56:04,486
[♪ intriguing music playing]

970
00:56:08,991 --> 00:56:10,993
[ringing continues]

971
00:56:18,500 --> 00:56:19,543
Huh?

972
00:56:19,626 --> 00:56:20,627
What?

973
00:56:25,841 --> 00:56:26,842
What is it?

974
00:56:31,179 --> 00:56:34,141
[Sanghyun] Come back
to where the game started.

975
00:56:34,224 --> 00:56:36,560
Come over there? Okay.

976
00:56:38,103 --> 00:56:40,230
Okay. Okay, got it.

977
00:56:48,030 --> 00:56:49,948
[whispers] The Pool is too dangerous.

978
00:56:51,658 --> 00:56:52,951
This is driving me crazy.

979
00:56:56,038 --> 00:56:57,164
As for Jimin...

980
00:56:59,166 --> 00:57:01,543
I'm not sure if I can trust her.
This is nuts.

981
00:57:07,215 --> 00:57:09,217
[♪ foreboding music playing]

982
00:57:11,011 --> 00:57:12,929
[footsteps approaching]

983
00:57:16,975 --> 00:57:20,395
What the heck? Hold on! What the heck?

984
00:57:21,355 --> 00:57:23,357
[♪ exciting music playing]

985
00:57:24,191 --> 00:57:26,652
Hold on! What the heck?

986
00:57:28,987 --> 00:57:31,406
[ZZONE screams]

987
00:57:34,326 --> 00:57:35,327
Help!

988
00:57:36,370 --> 00:57:38,455
[screams]

989
00:57:45,003 --> 00:57:48,090
Get out of the pool!

990
00:57:48,173 --> 00:57:49,174
[patch rips]

991
00:57:49,800 --> 00:57:51,009
[groans disappointedly]

992
00:57:52,678 --> 00:57:54,221
[host] Tag confirmed.

993
00:57:54,304 --> 00:57:55,430
EUNSIL TAGS ZZONE

994
00:57:56,556 --> 00:57:58,934
-Let's go.
-[ZZONE] I should've hidden.

995
00:57:59,017 --> 00:58:00,602
Why did I not notice?

996
00:58:02,104 --> 00:58:04,606
Something felt off. I went to the Pool...

997
00:58:05,190 --> 00:58:08,777
and it felt like someone was hiding
and watching me from behind a pillar.

998
00:58:08,860 --> 00:58:11,113
I spotted ZZONE.

999
00:58:11,196 --> 00:58:13,031
I saw her shadow,

1000
00:58:13,115 --> 00:58:16,743
and I figured it was the perfect spot
to trick someone.

1001
00:58:16,827 --> 00:58:18,453
So I went around and caught her.

1002
00:58:18,954 --> 00:58:22,290
JANG EUNSIL

1003
00:58:24,167 --> 00:58:26,837
Hold on! What the heck?

1004
00:58:26,920 --> 00:58:29,881
I'm the first one here. Thank you.

1005
00:58:29,965 --> 00:58:31,174
[exhales]

1006
00:58:31,258 --> 00:58:33,218
JANG EUNSIL'S PRISON
ZZONE

1007
00:58:33,301 --> 00:58:34,553
Thank you.

1008
00:58:36,054 --> 00:58:41,727
REMAINING TIME

1009
00:58:41,810 --> 00:58:45,105
HOTEL MAIN ENTRANCE

1010
00:58:45,647 --> 00:58:49,985
GENERAL CLUES: 3
DECISIVE CLUES: 0

1011
00:58:51,278 --> 00:58:53,405
Damn it, where are my clues?

1012
00:58:54,531 --> 00:58:57,951
5 MINUTES LEFT
YANG DAIL'S LOOKING FOR THE LAST CLUE

1013
00:58:58,034 --> 00:58:59,035
HOTEL REAR ENTRANCE

1014
00:58:59,119 --> 00:59:00,537
[Jieun] Is this a dead end?

1015
00:59:01,455 --> 00:59:03,957
GENERAL CLUES: 3
DECISIVE CLUES: 1

1016
00:59:04,040 --> 00:59:06,334
ALL CLUES SECURED

1017
00:59:08,795 --> 00:59:11,298
ENTERING THE HOTEL TO FIND A SPOT TO HIDE

1018
00:59:17,721 --> 00:59:19,306
[♪ fast-paced music playing]

1019
00:59:20,682 --> 00:59:21,683
Damn it!

1020
00:59:23,143 --> 00:59:24,269
[Sanghyun] Who's missing?

1021
00:59:24,352 --> 00:59:25,437
YOUN SANGHYUN WAS NEARBY

1022
00:59:25,520 --> 00:59:26,521
Shin Jieun!

1023
00:59:34,654 --> 00:59:36,823
Dail, run!

1024
00:59:36,907 --> 00:59:37,908
Run!

1025
00:59:38,658 --> 00:59:39,659
Run!

1026
00:59:45,123 --> 00:59:46,124
Where do I go?

1027
00:59:46,875 --> 00:59:47,876
[shouts]

1028
00:59:48,835 --> 00:59:50,003
[exclaims frustratedly]

1029
00:59:51,087 --> 00:59:54,007
JANG EUNSIL CLOSES IN FAST

1030
00:59:59,846 --> 01:00:01,723
DID HE GET AWAY?

1031
01:00:02,224 --> 01:00:04,643
HERE COMES YUK JUNSEO

1032
01:00:13,485 --> 01:00:16,154
[footsteps]

1033
01:00:18,073 --> 01:00:20,325
[Dail] I thought I got away
and went outside.

1034
01:00:21,034 --> 01:00:22,536
HERE COMES YOUN SANGHYUN

1035
01:00:23,078 --> 01:00:24,079
[sighs]

1036
01:00:29,626 --> 01:00:33,880
That's when I got really competitive,
and I had to catch him.

1037
01:00:46,476 --> 01:00:47,477
Dail!

1038
01:00:51,565 --> 01:00:52,566
Dail!

1039
01:00:53,567 --> 01:00:54,860
[patch rips]

1040
01:00:54,943 --> 01:00:55,944
[exhales]

1041
01:00:56,027 --> 01:00:57,529
[host] Tag confirmed.

1042
01:00:57,612 --> 01:00:59,948
[sighs] Just my luck.

1043
01:01:00,031 --> 01:01:02,492
SHIN JIEUN AND YANG DAIL WERE TAGGED

1044
01:01:02,576 --> 01:01:05,078
4 MINUTES TO GO

1045
01:01:05,161 --> 01:01:07,956
Who's left now? Did we get Jimin?

1046
01:01:08,039 --> 01:01:09,583
-No, not yet.
-I'll call HQ.

1047
01:01:10,458 --> 01:01:12,168
-[Junseo] Who?
-Jimin. This person.

1048
01:01:13,753 --> 01:01:14,880
-We got her.
-Really?

1049
01:01:14,963 --> 01:01:16,381
There's someone else.

1050
01:01:16,464 --> 01:01:18,091
-Did we get everyone?
-Pani Bottle.

1051
01:01:18,174 --> 01:01:19,301
Yeah, he's still out there.

1052
01:01:19,384 --> 01:01:21,428
If one more person's caught, it's over.

1053
01:01:23,555 --> 01:01:24,556
[sighs heavily]

1054
01:01:25,724 --> 01:01:27,183
The cop selections were bad.

1055
01:01:29,686 --> 01:01:31,730
Pani Bottle should've been a cop.

1056
01:01:32,772 --> 01:01:34,524
Then, we could've run away forever.

1057
01:01:35,108 --> 01:01:37,903
If I were a cop, I wouldn't have caught
a single person.

1058
01:01:39,321 --> 01:01:40,906
It's going to be over soon.

1059
01:01:41,531 --> 01:01:43,074
There's about three minutes left.

1060
01:01:43,575 --> 01:01:48,455
REMAINING TIME

1061
01:01:48,538 --> 01:01:49,831
-Call HQ.
-Okay.

1062
01:01:51,041 --> 01:01:53,460
Please tell us Pani Bottle's location.

1063
01:01:54,502 --> 01:02:00,008
COPS ARE ALLOWED TO LOOK UP
A CRIMINAL'S LOCATION ONCE PER ROUND

1064
01:02:00,091 --> 01:02:01,092
[phone rings]

1065
01:02:01,176 --> 01:02:02,594
-The Grounds.
-[Junseo] Okay.

1066
01:02:03,887 --> 01:02:06,264
[Sanghyun] We'll find him soon
if he's at the Grounds.

1067
01:02:06,765 --> 01:02:09,184
[Junseo] I wanted to track down
every last one of them.

1068
01:02:10,810 --> 01:02:13,980
-You check this side.
-Sure, this side?

1069
01:02:14,064 --> 01:02:15,148
Yeah, outside.

1070
01:02:15,231 --> 01:02:17,567
-Eunsil, check over there. I'll go here.
-Okay.

1071
01:02:21,613 --> 01:02:22,822
I will find him.

1072
01:02:27,077 --> 01:02:28,328
Pani Bottle...

1073
01:02:28,870 --> 01:02:31,331
A FRANTIC SEARCH BEFORE TIME RUNS OUT

1074
01:02:34,584 --> 01:02:36,252
[Eunsil] I feel like he's hiding.

1075
01:02:39,172 --> 01:02:41,883
Where is he?
He must be hiding somewhere strange.

1076
01:02:45,553 --> 01:02:47,847
[host] Two minutes remaining.

1077
01:02:53,770 --> 01:03:00,735
SNOW REMOVAL SUPPLIES

1078
01:03:00,819 --> 01:03:01,820
[objects rattle]

1079
01:03:05,615 --> 01:03:07,075
[Pani Bottle]
God, just stay the fuck away.

1080
01:03:07,575 --> 01:03:08,868
Why do you keep coming?

1081
01:03:16,001 --> 01:03:18,712
I had to find four clues in Round 1.
I had found three.

1082
01:03:18,795 --> 01:03:20,005
I needed to find one more.

1083
01:03:20,088 --> 01:03:21,881
I saw a snow removal supply box
in the photo.

1084
01:03:21,965 --> 01:03:25,927
It was exactly my size.
It was like a cozy studio apartment.

1085
01:03:35,478 --> 01:03:37,689
So I stayed there and waited it out.

1086
01:03:37,772 --> 01:03:39,315
I figured as long as I hold out,

1087
01:03:39,399 --> 01:03:41,818
I could survive Round 1
without being interrogated.

1088
01:03:44,779 --> 01:03:46,823
[Sanghyun] Has Pani Bottle vanished?

1089
01:03:46,906 --> 01:03:50,076
I couldn't possibly find Pani Bottle.

1090
01:03:50,160 --> 01:03:51,161
I didn't see him.

1091
01:03:51,244 --> 01:03:55,123
[Sanghyun] I knew he was at the Grounds,
but I didn't know exactly where.

1092
01:03:55,206 --> 01:03:57,208
[Junseo] Time's running out. Let's run.

1093
01:03:59,044 --> 01:04:00,253
[Sanghyun] He's at the Grounds?

1094
01:04:01,046 --> 01:04:02,047
The Grounds?

1095
01:04:03,715 --> 01:04:04,716
He's at the Grounds?

1096
01:04:05,717 --> 01:04:08,053
-That's impossible.
-[Junseo] Go in there.

1097
01:04:08,136 --> 01:04:10,597
All three of us
should've looked for him together.

1098
01:04:11,389 --> 01:04:12,724
But I think it was too late.

1099
01:04:13,349 --> 01:04:14,893
How could he be at the Grounds?

1100
01:04:16,519 --> 01:04:18,021
[Eunsil] We didn't know where he was.

1101
01:04:19,355 --> 01:04:20,648
Time was running short.

1102
01:04:21,149 --> 01:04:23,401
[Sanghyun] So I felt a lot of pressure.

1103
01:04:24,360 --> 01:04:26,863
[Junseo] Pani Bottle was nowhere in sight.

1104
01:04:27,947 --> 01:04:30,116
Even so, we didn't give up until the end.

1105
01:04:33,453 --> 01:04:38,458
REMAINING TIME

1106
01:04:48,218 --> 01:04:49,636
I was like, "Uh-oh!"

1107
01:04:51,054 --> 01:04:53,389
[Pani Bottle breathing nervously]

1108
01:04:57,102 --> 01:04:58,937
[♪ tense music playing]

1109
01:04:59,020 --> 01:05:02,482
I felt like I'd get caught
if I moved even a little bit.

1110
01:05:02,565 --> 01:05:06,111
It was as if I was someone
hiding among the dead

1111
01:05:06,194 --> 01:05:07,487
in World War II.

1112
01:05:07,570 --> 01:05:10,406
If they found me, I'd get shot.

1113
01:05:14,702 --> 01:05:16,287
I stayed absolutely still.

1114
01:05:48,695 --> 01:05:50,530
[footsteps approaching]

1115
01:06:07,297 --> 01:06:10,884
REMAINING TIME

1116
01:06:10,967 --> 01:06:12,927
[clock ticking]

1117
01:06:17,557 --> 01:06:19,058
[buzzer sounds]

1118
01:06:20,560 --> 01:06:23,396
[host] Round 1's chase is over.

1119
01:06:24,105 --> 01:06:26,608
All surviving criminals,
please gather in the Main Hall.

1120
01:06:26,691 --> 01:06:27,984
ROUND 1'S CHASE HAS ENDED

1121
01:06:28,067 --> 01:06:29,819
"Surviving criminals,
go to the Main Hall."

1122
01:06:30,320 --> 01:06:31,696
How many survived then?

1123
01:06:32,197 --> 01:06:33,448
[Joonsu] Just one, right?

1124
01:06:33,531 --> 01:06:35,366
Is it only Pani Bottle?

1125
01:06:35,950 --> 01:06:37,327
How did he pull it off?

1126
01:06:37,410 --> 01:06:39,495
I thought he'd be the easiest to catch.

1127
01:06:42,123 --> 01:06:46,377
SNOW REMOVAL SUPPLIES

1128
01:06:52,091 --> 01:06:53,092
[exhales]

1129
01:06:56,012 --> 01:06:57,013
[exclaims]

1130
01:06:57,096 --> 01:06:58,640
Time's dragging on like hell.

1131
01:07:01,309 --> 01:07:02,310
[groans]

1132
01:07:04,979 --> 01:07:06,314
[sighs]

1133
01:07:07,190 --> 01:07:08,983
-Mr. Pani Bottle.
-Yes?

1134
01:07:09,067 --> 01:07:11,945
You are the only criminal who survived.

1135
01:07:12,028 --> 01:07:13,029
I see.

1136
01:07:13,112 --> 01:07:15,198
Please put every clue you found
on the table.

1137
01:07:15,281 --> 01:07:18,952
MISSION REWARD: SURVIVORS
CAN DESTROY ALL OF THEIR CLUES

1138
01:07:19,035 --> 01:07:20,662
[dealer] I'll examine the clues.

1139
01:07:21,329 --> 01:07:24,666
You found a handkerchief,
cotton gloves, energy gum,

1140
01:07:24,749 --> 01:07:26,793
and a designer bag.

1141
01:07:26,876 --> 01:07:27,877
[Pani Bottle] Right.

1142
01:07:27,961 --> 01:07:30,755
The designer bag is an incorrect clue.

1143
01:07:30,838 --> 01:07:32,715
[♪ intriguing music playing]

1144
01:07:32,799 --> 01:07:34,968
[Pani Bottle] But it was here.

1145
01:07:36,052 --> 01:07:37,303
What the heck?

1146
01:07:37,387 --> 01:07:39,764
Can you double-check your profile card?

1147
01:07:40,848 --> 01:07:41,849
CLUES

1148
01:07:41,933 --> 01:07:43,393
OCT 22, 2025
JOB: CAR KEYS, GUM, GLOVES

1149
01:07:43,476 --> 01:07:44,894
CRIME: RECEIPT, HANDKERCHIEF, DEAD PHONE

1150
01:07:44,978 --> 01:07:46,729
OF NOTE: EARPLUGS, DECAF COFFEE,
BOTTLE OF SLEEPING PILLS

1151
01:07:46,813 --> 01:07:50,483
I checked the profile card,
and it said nothing about designer bags.

1152
01:07:50,566 --> 01:07:53,194
But I found the clue here.

1153
01:07:53,278 --> 01:07:55,571
[dealer] It has nothing to do with you.

1154
01:07:59,367 --> 01:08:02,704
[Pani Bottle] There were supposed
to be earplugs, but I couldn't find them.

1155
01:08:07,500 --> 01:08:09,502
Are there two snow removal supply boxes?

1156
01:08:10,712 --> 01:08:13,548
24 MINUTES BEFORE PANI BOTTLE CAME

1157
01:08:23,057 --> 01:08:26,269
HORSEKING HID HIS CLUE
IN THE SNOW REMOVAL SUPPLY BOX

1158
01:08:27,520 --> 01:08:28,813
Let's look outside.

1159
01:08:29,897 --> 01:08:30,898
[mumbling]

1160
01:08:33,484 --> 01:08:36,279
I can't stop thinking about
those three clues I left.

1161
01:08:36,362 --> 01:08:37,530
It's driving me crazy.

1162
01:08:37,613 --> 01:08:40,116
You can go find them all next round.
You can find five.

1163
01:08:40,825 --> 01:08:42,076
I found it in the box.

1164
01:08:42,160 --> 01:08:43,453
CONFUSED BY HORSEKING

1165
01:08:43,536 --> 01:08:44,996
They should've been earplugs.

1166
01:08:45,621 --> 01:08:48,291
[dealer] The designer bag
is an incorrect clue.

1167
01:08:48,374 --> 01:08:50,209
Since you brought an incorrect clue,

1168
01:08:50,293 --> 01:08:52,295
three will be revealed to all
as a penalty.

1169
01:08:52,378 --> 01:08:54,797
We'll dispose of the remaining clues.

1170
01:08:54,881 --> 01:08:56,507
Please return to the Main Hall.

1171
01:08:57,091 --> 01:08:58,259
How did this happen?

1172
01:09:01,596 --> 01:09:03,139
[Pani Bottle] That's when I realized

1173
01:09:03,222 --> 01:09:05,641
it was someone else's,
and I was missing something.

1174
01:09:05,725 --> 01:09:08,644
At that moment,
I was out of it and couldn't move,

1175
01:09:08,728 --> 01:09:10,563
so I never really checked it.

1176
01:09:10,646 --> 01:09:12,273
I couldn't risk getting caught.

1177
01:09:12,357 --> 01:09:14,359
That's when I knew something was wrong.

1178
01:09:16,736 --> 01:09:19,655
[host] All cops,
please go to your interrogation rooms.

1179
01:09:20,740 --> 01:09:22,867
-We caught a lot.
-Right.

1180
01:09:22,950 --> 01:09:24,702
-Save for one, we got them all.
-[Sanghyun] Yeah.

1181
01:09:27,246 --> 01:09:29,123
Seriously...

1182
01:09:30,166 --> 01:09:31,959
I underestimated the cops.

1183
01:09:35,463 --> 01:09:36,964
I can't survive Round 2.

1184
01:09:37,048 --> 01:09:39,217
If I get caught in Round 2, isn't it over?

1185
01:09:39,300 --> 01:09:42,470
-We have to survive 70 minutes in Round 2.
-[Jieun] What should we do?

1186
01:09:42,553 --> 01:09:44,889
At this point,
the cops have the upper hand...

1187
01:09:45,640 --> 01:09:48,184
because they're taking key clues
from each of us.

1188
01:09:48,267 --> 01:09:49,977
One each from the nine of us.

1189
01:09:52,271 --> 01:09:54,649
If we're the criminals...

1190
01:09:55,274 --> 01:09:57,610
then the only way we can win

1191
01:09:57,694 --> 01:10:00,446
is by identifying
the Good Citizens or the Madman.

1192
01:10:00,530 --> 01:10:03,032
We already got caught,
so we can't help that.

1193
01:10:04,200 --> 01:10:07,578
If we find the Good Citizens
or the Madman, we'll win.

1194
01:10:07,662 --> 01:10:10,665
Yeah, we need to identify them.
But we don't know who they are.

1195
01:10:10,748 --> 01:10:12,709
[Jimin] I think
we should at least do that.

1196
01:10:12,792 --> 01:10:14,127
We should find the Good Citizens.

1197
01:10:15,503 --> 01:10:18,339
Should we pretend to be Good Citizens
in front of the cops?

1198
01:10:18,423 --> 01:10:19,674
[Jieun] Yeah.

1199
01:10:19,757 --> 01:10:22,385
-[Junseo] Hello.
-[Jaegyun] Are you here to let us out?

1200
01:10:22,468 --> 01:10:24,220
I need to interrogate you.

1201
01:10:24,303 --> 01:10:25,513
[all exclaim]

1202
01:10:25,596 --> 01:10:28,224
[Sanghyun] It's only 10 minutes.
Interrogation time.

1203
01:10:28,307 --> 01:10:29,892
[Ddolddol] I tried so hard to find clues.

1204
01:10:30,977 --> 01:10:32,353
[Horseking] This is so unfair.

1205
01:10:35,523 --> 01:10:37,525
[ZZONE chuckles] This is crazy.

1206
01:10:39,360 --> 01:10:41,362
[♪ unsettling music playing]

1207
01:10:43,531 --> 01:10:44,532
INTERROGATION ROOM

1208
01:10:44,615 --> 01:10:47,910
[Dail] I think we can confuse them
with our words

1209
01:10:47,994 --> 01:10:51,539
to mislead them enough
and hide what crime we committed.

1210
01:10:52,498 --> 01:10:54,083
I'm...

1211
01:10:54,167 --> 01:10:56,002
a terrible liar, and it shows.

1212
01:10:57,003 --> 01:10:58,755
[Dail] This isn't going to be easy.

1213
01:10:58,838 --> 01:10:59,922
GULP

1214
01:11:00,590 --> 01:11:03,134
[Jieun] I'll try to stay quiet
as much as possible.

1215
01:11:04,427 --> 01:11:08,514
[Junseo] I tried to come up with questions
that would put them under pressure

1216
01:11:08,598 --> 01:11:10,308
during the interrogation.

1217
01:11:11,350 --> 01:11:13,811
[Eunsil] From the moment
I entered the interrogation room,

1218
01:11:13,895 --> 01:11:16,731
I felt intimidated by the atmosphere.

1219
01:11:17,607 --> 01:11:20,318
So I decided to keep things
as serious as possible.

1220
01:11:21,110 --> 01:11:22,320
What's your nationality?

1221
01:11:24,947 --> 01:11:26,240
I'm from...

1222
01:11:26,324 --> 01:11:27,658
Heaven.

1223
01:11:27,742 --> 01:11:28,826
I'm an Angel.

1224
01:11:29,577 --> 01:11:32,246
I'm mixed race.
I'm half Heaven and half Korean.

1225
01:11:34,749 --> 01:11:35,750
[snorts]

1226
01:11:35,833 --> 01:11:38,044
-You're quite unique.
-[ZZONE chuckles]

1227
01:11:38,127 --> 01:11:41,047
Was there any murder weapon you used?

1228
01:11:42,507 --> 01:11:44,342
-It's a secret.
-[Junseo] A secret?

1229
01:11:45,343 --> 01:11:47,929
You've chosen
to say as little as possible, haven't you?

1230
01:11:48,012 --> 01:11:49,347
-[Jaegyun] Of course.
-Hmm...

1231
01:11:49,430 --> 01:11:51,808
It'll be tough.
No one's going to say anything.

1232
01:11:53,643 --> 01:11:54,811
How old are you?

1233
01:11:56,687 --> 01:11:57,897
I'm in my thirties.

1234
01:11:57,980 --> 01:11:59,690
-[Sanghyun] In your thirties?
-I'm a woman.

1235
01:12:01,234 --> 01:12:03,319
-A woman in her thirties?
-[Ddolddol] Yes.

1236
01:12:03,402 --> 01:12:04,862
I'm a witch.

1237
01:12:04,946 --> 01:12:06,447
[Sanghyun] A witch?

1238
01:12:07,114 --> 01:12:08,324
Is he serious?

1239
01:12:08,407 --> 01:12:10,660
Or is he joking? I wasn't sure.

1240
01:12:11,536 --> 01:12:12,787
Hold on.

1241
01:12:12,870 --> 01:12:15,122
-I need to check something.
-[Ddolddol] Sure.

1242
01:12:15,832 --> 01:12:18,417
You're supposed to submit
your clues to me.

1243
01:12:18,501 --> 01:12:21,128
CAUGHT CRIMINALS MUST GIVE
A GENERAL AND DECISIVE CLUE

1244
01:12:21,212 --> 01:12:22,338
Here are the clues.

1245
01:12:22,421 --> 01:12:23,422
GIVES CLUES RIGHT AWAY

1246
01:12:25,049 --> 01:12:28,594
[Sanghyun] He took out the clues,
and I was a little thrown off.

1247
01:12:28,678 --> 01:12:29,679
Is this right?

1248
01:12:30,471 --> 01:12:32,098
-Write it down fast.
-Sure, thirties...

1249
01:12:32,181 --> 01:12:33,516
I'm here to help you out.

1250
01:12:33,599 --> 01:12:34,725
-Is that so?
-An alcoholic.

1251
01:12:34,809 --> 01:12:35,810
WHO'S THE COP?

1252
01:12:35,893 --> 01:12:36,978
"An alcoholic."

1253
01:12:37,061 --> 01:12:38,896
A high heel to the manager's head...

1254
01:12:39,605 --> 01:12:42,108
You hit the manager
in the head with a high heel?

1255
01:12:42,191 --> 01:12:43,234
Yes, I took his valuables.

1256
01:12:43,317 --> 01:12:44,485
THE WITCH ADMITS HER CRIME

1257
01:12:45,278 --> 01:12:47,238
Is it okay to spill everything like this?

1258
01:12:47,321 --> 01:12:50,199
-Sure, I'm a Good Citizen.
-[Sanghyun] "A Good Citizen."

1259
01:12:51,284 --> 01:12:52,285
What?

1260
01:12:52,785 --> 01:12:56,330
What was that?
I think I was a little flustered.

1261
01:12:56,414 --> 01:12:58,207
Kim Ddolddol

1262
01:12:58,291 --> 01:13:02,712
was trying to prove then
that he was a Good Citizen.

1263
01:13:03,296 --> 01:13:05,798
You know what Joonsu will say?
He's a nurse...

1264
01:13:05,882 --> 01:13:08,009
-And what else?
-[Sanghyun] Joonsu is Burglar 3

1265
01:13:08,092 --> 01:13:09,760
and had an e-cigarette.

1266
01:13:09,844 --> 01:13:13,764
When Joonsu came in,
I compared that with Joonsu's clues.

1267
01:13:14,432 --> 01:13:15,516
Evidence.

1268
01:13:15,600 --> 01:13:16,684
You mean the clues?

1269
01:13:17,727 --> 01:13:18,728
Here you go.

1270
01:13:19,437 --> 01:13:23,232
[Sanghyun] Joonsu brought an e-cigarette
and a liquid cartridge.

1271
01:13:23,316 --> 01:13:24,984
It was exactly what he said.

1272
01:13:26,027 --> 01:13:29,113
I was able to catch
both Ddolddol and Joonsu.

1273
01:13:29,655 --> 01:13:31,616
I think Ddolddol was a huge help.

1274
01:13:33,034 --> 01:13:35,036
[footsteps approaching]

1275
01:13:35,119 --> 01:13:37,163
SOMEONE ARRIVES AT THE INTERROGATION ROOM

1276
01:13:37,246 --> 01:13:38,581
[knocks on door]

1277
01:13:39,373 --> 01:13:40,708
Come in.

1278
01:13:40,791 --> 01:13:42,251
Hello.

1279
01:13:43,252 --> 01:13:45,338
[♪ dramatic music playing]

1280
01:13:45,421 --> 01:13:47,423
[distorted voice]
Did you catch all the Drug Criminals?

1281
01:13:47,506 --> 01:13:48,883
[Eunsil] We're working on it.

1282
01:13:49,550 --> 01:13:52,261
[distorted voice]
Aren't they Jimin and ZZONE?

1283
01:13:53,804 --> 01:13:56,599
This is all I can tell you.

1284
01:13:57,892 --> 01:13:59,977
[Junseo] Any info
about the other suspects?

1285
01:14:00,061 --> 01:14:02,355
[distorted voice]
I know a few things, including that.

1286
01:14:02,855 --> 01:14:05,107
I'll make it simple for you.

1287
01:14:05,816 --> 01:14:07,276
[Sanghyun] Are you a Good Citizen?

1288
01:14:08,527 --> 01:14:09,654
[distorted voice] Yes.

1289
01:14:09,737 --> 01:14:11,656
[♪ soft, eerie music playing]

1290
01:14:31,676 --> 01:14:33,678
Translated by Youji Kim
